 "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn4le15ob08re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn4le15ob08re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn4le15ob08re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "Lima's history can be traced to its colorful past. Before the 12th century, the area was inhabited by many indigenous groups.  After this period, the powerful Inca Empire became the dominant culture. This highly advanced civilization called their empire Tawantinsuyu, the \u201cLand of the Four Corners\u201d.", "id": 1, "time": "1", "image": "engenn4le15ob08re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "Their language was Quechua. The empire grew to include northern Chile and parts of Bolivia and Ecuador before the Spanish invaded in 1531. Francisco Pizarro captured Cuzco in 1533 and established the city of Lima. The new inhabitants used gold and silver found in the Andes Mountains to increase the country's power.", "id": 2, "time": "24000", "image": "engenn4le15ob08re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "In 1821, Peru became an independent country by defeating the Spanish. Since that time, African, Asian and other European cultures have made Lima a melting pot.", "id": 3, "time": "49300", "image": "engenn4le15ob08re2img01.jpg"}]}}]}, {"id": 2, "type": "video", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"video_src": "engenn4le15ob08re3vid01", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": ""}, {"text": "<span class = \"bullet\">How to write a paragraph about the history of a place</span>", "id": 1, "time": "5000", "image": ""}, {"text": "<span class = \"bullet\">What are the steps?</span>", "id": 2, "time": "15000", "image": ""}, {"text": "<span class = \"bullet\">Important reminders</span>", "id": 3, "time": "90000", "image": ""}]}}]}]}], "type": "sena"}